  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "aa13fb22-b592-411d-9110-7f26898f26f1",
    "name": "Task Management Platform",
    "description": "StartFragment\n\n# Task Management Platform API Collection\n\nThis Postman collection contains APIs for a microservices-based task management platform built with Spring Boot.\n\n## Services\n\n- Auth Service → localhost:8081\n    \n- Task Service → localhost:8082\n    \n\n## Features\n\n- JWT Authentication (HS256)\n    \n- Role-Based Access Control (RBAC)\n    \n- Secure inter-service communication\n    \n- Project and task management\n    \n- Task assignment\n    \n- Workflow/status transition validation\n    \n\n## Roles\n\n### ADMIN\n\n- Manage users\n    \n- Create/update/delete projects\n    \n- Create/update/delete tasks\n    \n- Assign tasks\n    \n\n### USER\n\n- View projects/tasks\n    \n- Access own profile\n    \n- View assigned tasks\n    \n\n## Notes\n\n- Login requests automatically store JWT tokens into collection variables.\n    \n- Project/task IDs are automatically stored after creation requests.\n    \n- APIs are grouped by domain for easier testing.\n    \n\nEndFragment",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "30468120"
  },
